    <bpmn:startEvent id="Start_37" name="Customer requests review for a purchased item or subscription">
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_37_1</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:startEvent>
    <bpmn:businessRuleTask id="Eligibility_37" name="Check customer ownership, completion, review unit and duplicate eligibility">
      <bpmn:documentation>FR-REV-01-03,07; BR-21. Require registered authenticated customer and owned purchase. Standard/cake: target item belongs to a completed order, at most one feedback per purchased item. Subscription: original owned enrollment has all four linked weekly fulfillments completed, with no review for that enrollment; individual weekly deliveries are rejected as review units. Read authoritative completion evidence, not customer/browser flags. No extra receipt-button requirement. A duplicate same-operation successful retry can return its result without another review; unrelated existing review is ineligible. Inconsistent/missing ownership/completion links cannot authorize saving.</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_37_29</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_37_1</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_37_2</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:businessRuleTask>
    <bpmn:exclusiveGateway id="Eligible_37" name="Owned, completed and not already reviewed?">
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_37_2</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_37_3</bpmn:outgoing>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_37_5</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:exclusiveGateway>
    <bpmn:serviceTask id="Reject_37" name="Explain ownership, incomplete purchase or duplicate-review reason">
      <bpmn:documentation>Return safe reason without disclosing another customer data. An incomplete order/cycle or separately targeted subscription week remains ineligible; correction cannot fabricate completion. Existing reviews remain intact. Customer may choose another actually eligible purchase through the entry task.</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_37_3</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_37_4</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:serviceTask>
    <bpmn:endEvent id="Rejected_37" name="Review not permitted for this purchase/unit">
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_37_4</bpmn:incoming>
    </bpmn:endEvent>
    <bpmn:userTask id="Compose_37" name="Select rating; optionally write comment and attach up to three photos">
      <bpmn:documentation>FR-REV-04-06. Select a supported rating (website 1-5 stars), optional comment and zero to three photos. No mandatory comment/photo. Review belongs to the selected owned purchased item or subscription enrollment; changing target requires full eligibility check. Customer may correct/remove attachments or cancel. Avoid inventing an SRS comment-length limit from preview-specific 300-character setting.</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_37_27</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_37_5</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_37_6</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:userTask>
    <bpmn:exclusiveGateway id="Confirm_37" name="Customer submits the review?">
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_37_6</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_37_7</bpmn:outgoing>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_37_8</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:exclusiveGateway>
    <bpmn:endEvent id="Cancel_37" name="Cancelled; no review saved by this attempt">
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_37_7</bpmn:incoming>
    </bpmn:endEvent>
    <bpmn:businessRuleTask id="Validate_37" name="Validate required rating, optional comment and supported photo count/type/size">
      <bpmn:documentation>FR-REV-04-06; NFR-SEC-08-09. Require valid supported rating (integer 1..5 in prototype). Comment may be empty; safely validate/encode submitted text without automated sentiment/profanity moderation. Photo list may be empty and cannot exceed three. Each new attachment must have a permitted image type/size under supported configured limits; reject executable/unsupported content before upload. Do not invent a hardcoded SRS size or mandatory photo. Returned file references must match this customer/draft, not arbitrary media IDs.</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_37_8</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_37_9</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:businessRuleTask>
    <bpmn:exclusiveGateway id="Valid_37" name="Rating/comment/photos valid?">
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_37_9</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_37_10</bpmn:outgoing>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_37_11</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:exclusiveGateway>
    <bpmn:serviceTask id="InputError_37" name="Explain missing/invalid rating, text or photo; retain review draft">
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_37_10</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_37_23</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:serviceTask>
    <bpmn:exclusiveGateway id="Photos_37" name="Any new photos need storage?">
      <bpmn:documentation>Zero photos or already successfully stored matching references do not require another upload. A changed/replaced file requires validation and storage; failed uploads are not treated as successful.</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_37_11</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_37_12</bpmn:outgoing>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_37_13</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:exclusiveGateway>
    <bpmn:serviceTask id="Upload_37" name="Store validated optional photos through backend to Cloudinary">
      <bpmn:documentation>Upload only validated required new media, retain usable references for this draft and distinguish partial successes from pending/failed files. Provider failure cannot create a saved review with missing/broken declared photo references. Customer may retry failed media, remove/replace optional photos or cancel; keep matching successful references for safe recovery. No unsupported provider-specific cleanup API or retry schedule is invented.</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_37_12</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_37_14</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:serviceTask>
    <bpmn:exclusiveGateway id="Uploaded_37" name="All selected photo references usable?">
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_37_14</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_37_15</bpmn:outgoing>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_37_16</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:exclusiveGateway>
    <bpmn:serviceTask id="UploadError_37" name="Explain photo-storage failure; preserve draft and usable references">
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_37_15</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_37_24</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:serviceTask>
    <bpmn:serviceTask id="Save_37" name="Recheck purchase eligibility; save one review with customer/purchase and photo links">
      <bpmn:documentation>FR-REV-01-07; BR-21; NFR-REL-03,05. At commit recheck authenticated customer, ownership, authoritative completion and unique review unit. Subscription completion remains all four fulfillments; no per-week feedback. Validate rating/comment and up to three matching stored photo references. Persist feedback and customer/purchased-item or original-enrollment association consistently; same successful request reuses saved result, concurrent different review for same unit rejects. No partial duplicate record/photo association. Failed save preserves prior records and draft for safe retry. Rechecking eligibility cannot convert an ineligible unit to an extra review. No Owner approval/classification is executed.</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_37_16</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_37_13</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_37_17</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:serviceTask>
    <bpmn:exclusiveGateway id="Result_37" name="Review save result?">
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_37_17</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_37_18</bpmn:outgoing>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_37_19</bpmn:outgoing>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_37_20</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:exclusiveGateway>
    <bpmn:serviceTask id="SaveError_37" name="Explain save/conflict issue; retain draft and latest saved review state">
      <bpmn:documentation>Transient failure can be retried after eligibility/content revalidation. A concurrently existing distinct review makes this unit ineligible and is not overwritten. Lost response may reuse matching known saved result instead of creating another review. Do not repeat successful photo uploads unnecessarily.</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_37_18</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_37_25</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:serviceTask>
    <bpmn:serviceTask id="Reuse_37" name="Reuse matching saved review; do not create a duplicate">
      <bpmn:documentation>The same customer/request already saved this same review. Keep its purchase association, content/photo references and moderation state; do not unhide or replace another review. Continue with confirmation of the existing saved result, not another publication.</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_37_19</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_37_21</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:serviceTask>
    <bpmn:serviceTask id="Show_37" name="Confirm saved review and make available under current visibility rules">
      <bpmn:documentation>Make saved feedback available to Owner viewing/moderation via BPMN-38 and display according to current saved visibility; do not create pending Owner approval or auto-hide/classify content. Prototype starts hidden=false. Do not unhide a previously moderated review on duplicate retry. Submission does not modify transaction completion, payments, product amounts or subscription progress.</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_37_21</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_37_20</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_37_22</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:serviceTask>
    <bpmn:endEvent id="End_37" name="Review saved once against eligible purchased item or enrollment">
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_37_22</bpmn:incoming>
    </bpmn:endEvent>
    <bpmn:userTask id="RecoveryReview_37" name="Review issue; correct draft/photos, reload eligibility and retry, or stop">
      <bpmn:documentation>Visible user recovery choices rather than abrupt retry end. Invalid rating/attachments need correction; optional failed photos may be removed. Same valid file may retry storage, successful references can be reused. Refresh purchase eligibility for save conflict; do not force a new login unless authentication actually fails. No review can be created for a cycle/order that is still incomplete.</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_37_25</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_37_24</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_37_23</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_37_26</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:userTask>
    <bpmn:exclusiveGateway id="Recovery_37" name="Customer recovery choice?">
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_37_26</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_37_27</bpmn:outgoing>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_37_28</bpmn:outgoing>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_37_29</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:exclusiveGateway>
    <bpmn:endEvent id="Stop_37" name="Stopped for now; no new review saved by this attempt">
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_37_28</bpmn:incoming>
    </bpmn:endEvent>
